{
  "_comment": [
    "app0:/fonts/fonts.json — the provenance record for every font this VPK",
    "ships. Tracked; the fonts themselves are not.",
    "",
    "vita/scripts/fetch-fonts.sh installs the files listed here into build/fonts/ and",
    "verifies each one against the sha256 below, so a stale or tampered font is a",
    "failed fetch rather than a surprise on the device. The pinned upstream",
    "archive and its own sha256 are recorded in that script, not here: one",
    "digest, one place. vita/scripts/package-vpk.sh packs the entries with",
    "packaged=true, and refuses to build a VPK whose fonts do not between them",
    "cover requiredCodepoints.",
    "",
    "requiredCodepoints is the launcher contract, not a nicety: the launcher",
    "picks the face it draws game titles with by probing glyphs (HIRAGANA A,",
    "KATAKANA A, CJK ONE), because Shift_JIS titles are common and the face is",
    "chosen by coverage rather than by name. Liberation Sans has none of the",
    "three, so a package carrying Liberation alone is not shippable.",
    "",
    "documents are the upstream licence and README files, kept beside the fonts",
    "in build/fonts/ and not packed here. The release VPK carries the font",
    "licence texts under app0:/licenses/ (VL-Gothic.txt, OFL-1.1-Liberation.txt;",
    "THIRD-PARTY.md at the repository root maps each font to its text)."
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "requiredCodepoints": ["U+3042", "U+30A2", "U+4E00"],
